flowchart LR
    U[Teacher or Coordinator] --> W[Next.js Web App]
    W --> A[FastAPI]
    A --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    A --> OSS[Alibaba OSS]
    A --> PF[Prefect]

    PF --> IW[Ingestion Worker]
    PF --> GW[Generation Worker]
    PF --> EW[Export Worker]

    IW --> MINERU[MinerU]
    IW --> POCR[PaddleOCR]
    IW --> QOCR[Qwen OCR]
    GW --> QWEN[Qwen Models]
    GW --> RETRIEVE[Hybrid Retrieval + Reranking]

    A --> GRAPH[NetworkX Graph Service]
    A --> SOLVER[OR-Tools CP-SAT]

    EW --> PACK[Static HTML + Paged.js]
